cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software (the platform code, not the /data directory
  contents — see the "License" section of README.md for why those are
  governed separately), please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  ICH Research DataBoard: a browser-only governance toolkit for
  intangible cultural heritage AI datasets
type: software
abstract: >-
  A browser-only MVP research prototype for Jiangxi Intangible Cultural
  Heritage (ICH) visual data governance: a Rights Gate for permission-scope
  enforcement, train/eval/holdout split governance with leakage checks, a
  knowledge-graph / ontology layer, an AI Generation Lab, and an append-only
  SHA-256 audit hash-chain. No build tools or server required — open
  src/index.html directly.
authors:
